        <div class="video">
          <div class="frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/Oy65hrjpLa8" title="TT-50 Truing Tool - Redesigned - Keeps your stone round and flat" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div>
          <p class="caption">Tormek: <em>TT-50 Truing Tool &ndash; Redesigned</em> (0:39)</p>
        </div>
