          <div class="frame"><iframe src="https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/fHD9GezQgwI" title="Keep your stone in perfect shape with the Tormek Truing Tool TT-50" loading="lazy" allowfullscreen allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"></iframe></div>
